            "review_text": "Chúc L\nTampa, Florida3 contributions\n1\nWonderful experience!!\nMay 2024 • Family\n- The restaurant is located between Wyndham and Citadines, very airy and cool.\n- Delicious food, very fresh seafood. Good price.\n- Cocktails are great\n- There is also a free mango dessert, friendly staff.\n\nWe will definitely come back on our next vacation.\nThank you for your enthusiastic and thoughtful service.\n#Social restaurant & Lounge bar\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 3, 2024",
